        "title": "Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MBSE replaces document-centric SE with a central authoritative model. Instead of a pile of documents (SRS, ICD, architecture description) that go out of sync with each other, the model IS the design. Documents are generated views of the model."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MBSE.md#003",
      "path": [
        "08-MBSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:systems-engineering:08-mbse, git-history:systems-engineering:08-mbse]",
        "canonical_path": "systems-engineering/08-MBSE.md",
        "concepts": "[mbse]",
        "current_path": "systems-engineering/08-MBSE.md",
        "id": "maxim:systems-engineering:mbse",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "systems-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mbse]",
        "section": "systems-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nDOCUMENT-CENTRIC SE (Traditional)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐\n│   SRS    │  │   ICD    │  │  Arch    │  │  FMEA    │\n│ v3.2.1   │  │ v2.1.0   │  │  Descr   │  │ v4.0     │\n└──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘\n     │              │              │             │\n     └──────────────┴──────────────┴─────────────┘\n                           │\n               No automated consistency check\n               Manual cross-referencing\n               Version drift inevitable\n               Requirement changed in SRS, not propagated to ICD\n               FMEA references wrong architecture version"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MBSE.md#004",
      "path": [
        "08-MBSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:systems-engineering:08-mbse, git-history:systems-engineering:08-mbse]",
        "canonical_path": "systems-engineering/08-MBSE.md",
        "concepts": "[mbse]",
        "current_path": "systems-engineering/08-MBSE.md",
        "id": "maxim:systems-engineering:mbse",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "systems-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mbse]",
        "section": "systems-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MODEL-BASED SE (MBSE)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                    ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n                    │       SYSTEM MODEL           │\n                    │                              │\n                    │  Requirements + Architecture │\n                    │  + Behavior + ICDs + Analyses│\n                    │  All in one consistent model │\n                    └──────────────────────────────┘\n                         │           │           │\n                         │  generate views       │\n                   ┌──────┘      ┌───┘       ┌──────┘\n                   ▼             ▼            ▼\n               SRS view      ICD view    Test view\n               (auto-gen)   (auto-gen)   (auto-gen)\n               Always        Always      Always\n               consistent    consistent  consistent\n```"
    },
    {
