      "text": "**Bridge**: MBSE is the software analog of moving from \"architecture documented in Word docs\" to \"architecture as code\" (Infrastructure as Code, OpenAPI specs, GraphQL schemas). The model is the single source of truth. Documents are derived artifacts."
    },
