      "text": "```\nMBSE MOTIVATION\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nProblem 1: Ambiguity in natural language\n  \"The system shall respond quickly\" → 10 engineers, 10 interpretations\n  Model: \"ResponseTime: Duration [unit=ms] ≤ 200\" → unambiguous"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MBSE.md#009",
      "path": [
        "08-MBSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:systems-engineering:08-mbse, git-history:systems-engineering:08-mbse]",
        "canonical_path": "systems-engineering/08-MBSE.md",
        "concepts": "[mbse]",
        "current_path": "systems-engineering/08-MBSE.md",
        "id": "maxim:systems-engineering:mbse",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "systems-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mbse]",
        "section": "systems-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Problem 2: Traceability is manual in documents\n  Requirement changed → manually find all affected items → miss some\n  Model: change requirement → automated impact analysis → consistent"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MBSE.md#010",
      "path": [
        "08-MBSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:systems-engineering:08-mbse, git-history:systems-engineering:08-mbse]",
