        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Problem 3: Integration of analysis\n  FEA model, FMEA spreadsheet, requirements doc → separate tools\n  Model: single data source → analysis driven from model data"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MBSE.md#011",
      "path": [
        "08-MBSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
