        "title": "Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Problem 4: Communication across disciplines\n  Mechanical engineer reads SRS differently from software engineer\n  Model: multiple views of same model → each discipline sees their view\n  Consistent because generated from same underlying data"
    },
